<title>UK: Argentina sets 200 mln Swiss franc seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 200 mln Swiss franc seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Paribas and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     7.0 PCT   MATURITY    04.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   EOS	   28.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 5-100     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
